{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 25, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the Land of the Rising Sun a most wondrous quest I shall now weave for thee.\n\n**Day the First Arrival in Tokyo**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth arrive\nAt Narita's gate where dreams revive.\nA taxi swift shall bear thee to thy keep\nIn Shinjuku's heights where shadows sleep.\nRest then good traveler for sights abound\nIn Tokyo's heart where wonders are found.\n\n**Day the Second Tokyo's Embrace**\n\nTo Tsukiji's fish market we shall go\nWhere freshest catches in abundance flow.\nThen wander through Asakusa's ancient grace\nAt Senso-ji Temple find thy sacred space.\nThe Imperial Palace a sight to behold\nA story of emperors bravely told.\n\n**Day the Third Hakone's Mountain Air**\n\nHakone we journey a mountain's delight\nWith views of Fuji bathed in morning light.\nA cruise on Lake Ashi a tranquil scene\nWhere nature's beauty ever is keen.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nTo ease thy weary spirit keep thee calm.\n\n**Day the Fourth Kyoto's Ancient Charm**\n\nBy bullet train we speed to Kyoto's door\nA city of temples forevermore.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermilion dream\nA thousand pathways a vibrant gleam.\nKiyomizu-dera's heights a wondrous view\nOf Kyoto's splendor forever new.\n\n**Day the Fifth Kyoto's Gardens Deep**\n\nIn Arashiyama's bamboo grove we tread\nWhere sunlight filters overhead.\nTenryu-ji Temple's garden serene\nA peaceful haven a tranquil sheen.\nGion's geishas a fleeting grace\nA glimpse of beauty in this ancient place.\n\n**Day the Sixth Nara's Deer Park Play**\n\nTo Nara we venture a deer's domain\nWhere friendly creatures roam again.\nTodai-ji Temple holds a giant's might\nA bronze Buddha bathed in golden light.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine with lanterns bright\nA mystical wonder a glorious sight.\n\n**Day the Seventh Osaka's Culinary Bliss**\n\nTo Osaka now we turn with joyful sound\nWhere culinary deligh